{"id":2671,"date":"2026-06-09T13:25:37","date_gmt":"2026-06-09T13:25:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2671"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:46:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:46:49","slug":"kota-green-waves-stone","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/kota-green-waves-stone\/","title":{"rendered":"Kota Green Acid Waves Stone"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"666\">Kota Green Waves is a premium natural stone recognized for its unique wave-like patterns and rich green shades that create a distinctive visual appeal. The naturally occurring textures and flowing formations give each piece its own character, making it an excellent choice for projects seeking an authentic and sophisticated natural stone finish.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"999\">Its versatile appearance blends seamlessly with both contemporary and traditional architectural styles, making it a preferred choice for architects, builders, and interior designers. Whether used in residential, commercial, hospitality, or landscape projects, Kota Green Waves adds depth, elegance, and timeless charm to any space.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1330\">Known for its durability and long-lasting performance, the stone is suitable for a variety of applications including flooring, wall cladding, pathways, courtyards, gardens, and outdoor living areas. The natural variations in color and pattern enhance its uniqueness, ensuring that every installation possesses a distinctive look.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1498\">Combining strength, natural beauty, and low maintenance, Kota Green Waves remains a popular choice for creating elegant spaces with a premium natural stone aesthetic.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11k4bfl\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1530\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1530\">Product Attributes<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_t